    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i hear you about the kidneys but it doesn't feel that bad, just annoying. i'm just really skeptical of doctors and the way they just push pills for everything. if i just did a massive dose of cranberry extract and some d-mannose every hour for a day, wouldn't that at least help flush the bacteria out so it's not an issue? i just want a way to fix this at home so i dont have to go to a clinic.",
