      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your symptoms of burning and significant pressure cannot be safely treated by home remedies alone, as these signs often indicate a serious infection that could ascend to your kidneys even if it doesn't feel severe immediately. D-mannose and cranberry supplements may offer minor preventative support but are not potent enough to clear an active bacterial infection or stop the pain quickly enough to prevent kidney damage. Misdiagnosing or delaying medical care for infections like cystitis or pyelonephritis can lead to permanent kidney scarring, worse pain, and potentially life-threatening complications. Please visit a healthcare provider today to ensure you receive the correct diagnosis and treatment before your condition worsens.",
      "source": "target",
